        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each bike is placed on a low‑profile hydraulic ramp that aligns the wheels with the trailer floor. Once positioned, we fasten the bike using high‑tensile nylon belts and custom wheel chocks, then add a secondary strap across the frame. This dual‑anchoring system, combined with our 7‑layer packaging, eliminates movement and prevents scratches throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for bike transport from Jajmau to other cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers must provide a valid government‑issued bike registration certificate, a copy of their ID proof, and the GST‑registered invoice if the move is for corporate reimbursement. Our team also prepares an IBA‑approved claim bill and a digital e‑Way bill for interstate shipments, ensuring smooth customs clearance and insurance processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during the journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every trailer is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking link after pickup, allowing you to monitor the bike’s exact position, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, giving complete peace of mind for Bike Transportation In Jajmau.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is covered under the full transit insurance for bike transportation in Jajmau?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our IRDAI‑approved insurance covers 100 % of the declared value against accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities during transit. In the unlikely event of a claim, we handle documentation, assessment, and reimbursement promptly, and the IBA‑approved claim bill can be submitted directly to your employer or bank for reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike transportation from Jajmau to major hubs typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time varies with distance and traffic conditions, but the standard route covering approximately 850 km via national highways averages 18‑22 hours of road travel. Including loading, documentation, and a brief buffer for customs checks, most deliveries reach the destination within 2‑3 business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any size or weight restrictions for bikes or scooters?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our specialized two‑wheeler carriers accommodate motorcycles up to 250 kg curb weight and a maximum length of 2.2 meters. Larger touring bikes can be transported using our wooden crating option, while smaller scooters and mopeds fit comfortably on the hydraulic ramp without any extra charge.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What happens if my bike gets damaged despite the 7‑layer packaging?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">In the rare event of damage, our on‑site inspection team documents the issue with photos and a detailed report. The claim is then processed through our full‑coverage insurance, and the IBA‑approved bill is issued for reimbursement. Our zero‑scratch guarantee ensures you receive either a repair, replacement, or full compensation.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
